#: includes/admin.php:435
msgid "Polish shapes new takes, Use this recording, clips and Share for feedback. The Original download always stays as recorded, and readings already on posts stay as they are until remade. Hear the polish in the review studio can try the EQ and the click lowering on one take before you switch them on here."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:439
msgid "Background noise reduction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:442
msgid "Engine"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:444
msgid "Engine: Standard (RNNoise, quick)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:445
msgid "Engine: Stronger (DeepFilterNet 3)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:450
msgid "Gentle: lowers the background by up to 12 dB"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:451
msgid "Medium: up to 20 dB (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:452
msgid "Strong: as far as the model goes"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:453
msgid "Off: the steady-hush reduction used before version 0.6.0"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:460
msgid "A small speech model (RNNoise) that tells your voice from fans, traffic and room noise, run on the reader's own computer after the reading ends. It is part of cleanup, so it applies when the reader leaves \"Clean up\" on. If the words start to sound watery or word endings get cut, choose a gentler setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:461
msgid "Stronger uses DeepFilterNet 3, a larger model that comes with the plugin. It also takes out sounds with a shape to them, such as a bell, a creaking chair or mouth sounds, and takes about twice as long. With Stronger, the Strong amount usually sounds best: a lower amount lets some of the noise back in. If a device is too slow for it, or it cannot load, that take uses Standard and the Room line says so. Hear the polish in the review studio can compare the two engines on one sentence first."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:465
msgid "Audiobook copy"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:467
msgid "Keep an audiobook copy: Use this recording also finishes the take with the Audiobook (ACX) preset, voice only, and keeps it for the collections' Audiobook box"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:468
msgid "About 1.4 MB a minute, in a folder visitors cannot open. A reading already on its post can get one from the review studio: Finish for, then Keep as this post's audiobook chapter."
msgstr ""

