msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:474
msgid "Quiet music under a reading. It plays alone for a few seconds, dips just before the first word, stays low under the voice, then rises again after the last word and fades out. It is mixed in last, after any editing, so the Whisper review always hears the voice alone and the Original download stays voice only. Use only music you own or have a licence for."
msgstr ""

