msgstr ""

#: includes/dl-method.php:44
msgid "A request for an episode file counts as one download once the podcast app has asked for the file's tags plus one minute of its audio, or for the whole file when the episode is shorter than a minute. When an app asks for the file in pieces, the pieces it asks for are added together. The size of each file's tags is measured from the file itself."
